---
source: tests/test_move.rs
expression: value
---
$ govctl work edit WI-<DATE>-001 acceptance_criteria[0] --tick done
Marked 'Task done' as done
exit: 0

$ govctl work move WI-<DATE>-001 done
Moved <DATE>-test-task.toml to done
exit: 0

$ govctl work list all
[
  {
    "id": "WI-<DATE>-001",
    "status": "done",
    "title": "Test task"
  }
]
exit: 0
